    "short_description": "Install and use godzilla-go to manage pipelines and connectors from Go.",
    "body": "<h1>Go SDK {{ds:component/chip|label=v2|variant=primary}}</h1>

{{ds:component/alert|variant=warning|title=Upcoming breaking change|body_html=<p>A breaking change is coming in the next major SDK release. Please review your integrations and upcoming release notes before upgrading.</p>}}

<p>A typed client for the <a href="{{cms:item/5beafa37-98de-44b6-9446-a99a2ace83a0}}">Godzilla REST API</a>, for Go 1.21+.</p>

<h2>Install</h2>
{{ds:component/code-block|filename=terminal|language=bash|code=go get github.com/godzilla/godzilla-go}}

<h2>Create a client</h2>
{{ds:component/code-block|filename=client.go|language=go|code=import "github.com/godzilla/godzilla-go"

client := godzilla.NewClient(os.Getenv("GODZILLA_API_KEY"))}}

<h2>Create a pipeline</h2>
<p>Maps directly onto the <a href="{{cms:item/18937bd0-7c49-4484-9f01-63bf86de09e3}}">Pipelines endpoint</a> — see the <a href="{{cms:item/352ec90a-373b-4f4a-aef2-e91062945b99}}">Building your first pipeline</a> guide for the concepts.</p>

{{ds:component/code-block|filename=create_pipeline.go|language=go|code=pipeline, err := client.Pipelines.Create(ctx, godzilla.PipelineParams{
    Name:                   "ingest-orders",
    SourceConnectorID:      "conn_pg_orders",
    DestinationConnectorID: "conn_snowflake_dw",
})}}

<h2>Replaying dead-lettered events</h2>
<p>Wraps the replay action described in <a href="{{cms:item/7a68c93c-96ae-4247-a45e-0a69c3aef336}}">Error handling & recovery</a>:</p>

{{ds:component/code-block|filename=replay.go|language=go|code=err := client.Events.Replay(ctx, "evt_8f2c1a90")}}

{{ds:component/alert|variant=info|title=Context support|body_html=<p>Every method accepts a standard <code>context.Context</code> as its first parameter for cancellation and timeout control.</p>}}",
